 ", tunic: c, sleeve: ": "",
 "You won the fight!": "",
 "Too slow! Try again.": "",
 "He got away! He doubled back, after him!": "",
 "Two men are waiting by the reservoir. Fight!": "",
 "You shouldn’t have opened that gate, boy. We were paid to keep it shut.": "",
 "Zealots of the brotherhood block your way. Fight them off!": "",
 "The stranger who talks to Hippasos! The diagonal dies with you, barbarian!": "",
 "You fight like you skate: badly, and somehow it works. Thank you.": "",
 "Kallias has sent men to grab the Governor. Stop them!": "",
 "Dock thug": "",
 "Hand over the spinning thing, wet boy. Kallias pays well for it.": "",
 "A temple servant snatched the Mirror Anchor and ran! Catch him before he reaches a boat!": "",
 "Temple servant": "",
 "Men maddened by Strife come at you in the dark. Fight!": "",
 "Maddened potter": "",
 "Maddened fisherman": "",
 "Get out! Get out of our city! Everyone out!": "",
 "Kleon’s men followed you from the trial. Fight!": "",
 "Kleon’s man": "",
 "Kleon says the foreigner talks too much. We’re here to help him stop.": "",
 "Politics in Athens. Always the same argument: three men and a stick.": "",
 "Two hired guards watch the hideout. Get past them!": "",
 "Hired guard": "",
 "The old man said nobody goes in until the young one comes. You’re young. Prove it.": "",
 "Kleon’s mob storms the Lyceum! Defend the machine!": "",
 "There! The foreigner’s monster-engine! Smash it before it calls down the gods!": "",
 "Stranger! The final cause of a philosopher is not usually fist-fighting. Today, I make an exception.": "",
 "Well fought, friend. I would have asked them what courage is, but you answered faster.": "",
 "What is on his face? Windows? He wears windows!": "",
 "Look, Mother, the barbarian has four eyes!": "",
 "Glass eyes! He must be a priest of some foreign god.": "",
 "Don’t look into his eye-circles, they say you can see your soul.": "",
 "Are those for seeing, or for scaring goats?": "",
 "I heard he can read writing from across the agora with those things.": "",
 "Crystal over the eyes! Even the Persian king doesn’t have those.": "",
 "Those crystals before your eyes… they bend the light, don’t they? Like water in a bowl. May I look through them? …The world melts! Wonderful!": "",
 "Lenses! On a frame! I could measure the stars with those. Where did you get them? No, don’t say “far away” again.": "",
 "They fogged up near the well? Of course they did. Air, thickening on glass. You carry proof of my theory on your nose.": "",
 "Two perfect circles, joined by a bridge. Whoever made these understood geometry. Sit, stranger. But in silence.": "",
 "You see the world through glass, and you think it is clearer. It is only a different river.": "",
 "A tool for the eyes. And still the eyes deceive. Glass on a liar does not make it honest.": "",
 "Before the light reaches your eye it must pass halfway through the glass, then half of half… how do you see anything at all?": "",
 "Fire in the eyes meets the light of things, so I teach. Those must be windows for the eye-fire! May I borrow them for my next speech?": "",
 "A lens. The Sun would set fire to dry grass through that, I think. Which proves it is a hot stone, by the way.": "",
 "Ha! Atoms of glass, arranged so the atoms of light bend just so. Magnificent. Ridiculous. Magnificent!": "",
 "You wear something to help you see. Tell me, friend: do they help you see what is true, or only what is there?": "",
 "A copy of an eye, laid over an eye. Even your sight is an imitation. Fascinating.": "",
 "Material: glass and horn. Form: two circles. Efficient cause: a skilled maker. Final cause… to see. Simple. I want a pair.": "",
 "Windows on your face. My husband would ask you a hundred questions about them. I only want to know if they help you fix roofs.": "",
 "Glass eyes. Now you can be ridiculous at a greater distance.": "",
 "Phone flashlight (F) for the tunnels. Battery: 81%.": "",
 "Phone compass: watch the needle near the seam.": "",
 "Glasses and barometer app: watch how the air behaves.": "",
 "Phone tuner app: it reads the strings in Hz.": "",
 "Smartwatch timer: rivers keep time too.": "",
 "Phone camera (Photo mode): cameras don’t see illusions made for eyes.": "",
 "Calculator and skateboard: infinite series, finite distances.": "",
 "Multitool: a screwdriver is all it takes to flip a polarity.": "",
 "Star map app: eclipses, explained.": "",
 "Phone battery: a little box of lightning.": "",
 "Voice recorder: Socrates sounds very convincing on a speaker.": "",
 "Flashlight (F) to dazzle a guard up close; smartwatch to count the patrols.": "",
 "Phone screen: a different kind of light for people who only know shadows.": "",
 "Photo gallery: every clue you’ve photographed.": "",
