 "“Solo sé que no cenaba.” Someone in Athens speaks Spanish. Or the poster painter does.": "",
 "A trade offer: you get a big wooden horse. Troy really should have read the small print.": "",
 "“Your death will come on an ordinary day.” Cheerful. The Stoics haven’t even been invented yet.": "",
 "Live a little. Okay. Noted. Right after I fix the time machine.": "",
 "“Courage is knowing it might hurt and doing it anyway. Stupidity is the same.” Homer gets me.": "",
 "That’s pretty much my whole trip, written on a wall.": "",
 "Aristotle: “A friend to all is a friend to none.” The crying cat agrees.": "",
 "Euripides: “He who abandons what is near to chase what is far ends up with nothing.” Ouch. Grandpa would say the same.": "",
 "That’s a painting of a man who has definitely lost his time machine.": "",
 "Alexander the Great, the ok, the meh… and just Alex. Every street artist ever.": "",
 "Just Alex. Honestly, my favourite.": "",
 "“Where did the fire start?” “In prehistory.” Prometheus would like a word.": "",
 "A cat that understands the history of fire better than I do.": "",
 "“What do you want?” “What does it mean to want?” “Say no more.” Best barber sign in history.": "",
